  FE -->|HTTP / REST| BE
  BE -->|exposes routes| Routes
  Routes --> Services
  Services -->|calls| Scrapers_Transforms
  Scrapers_Transforms -->|store raw articles| MinIO
  Scrapers_Transforms -->|store metadata| Postgres
  Services --> Utils
  BE --> Event[EventBroadcaster] --> FE
  BE -->|reads/writes| Postgres
  BE -->|uploads/downloads| MinIO

  Airflow -->|triggers| DAG1
  Airflow --> DAG2
  Airflow --> DAG3
  DAG1 -->|ingest from scrapers| MinIO
  DAG2 -->|transform in place| MinIO
  DAG3 -->|aggregate analytics| MinIO & Postgres
  Airflow -->|calls backend services / tasks| BE

  Compose --> Dockerfile
  Compose --> Postgres
  Compose --> MinIO
  Compose --> Airflow
  Compose --> BE
  Compose --> FE

  DataVolumes --> Postgres
  DataVolumes --> MinIO
  DataVolumes --> Airflow

  Tests --> BE
  Tests --> Services

